sequenceDiagram
  title Reconnect And Catchup Flow v4
  participant C as Client
  participant W as WS Gateway
  participant H as Redis State Hash
  participant S as Redis Stream
  participant API as REST Snapshot API

  C->>W: ROOM_JOIN(auctionId, lastSeq)
  W->>W: authenticate, Origin allowlist, join local room
  W->>H: HGET seq
  H-->>W: currentSeq

  alt lastSeq == currentSeq
    W-->>C: ROOM_SNAPSHOT(seq=currentSeq)
  else stream has missing events
    W->>S: XRANGE from lastSeq + 1 to currentSeq
    S-->>W: ordered events
    W-->>C: CATCHUP_EVENTS(seq...)
    W-->>C: ROOM_SNAPSHOT(seq=currentSeq)
  else stream trimmed or gap > 200
    W->>API: GET /api/auctions/{id}
    API-->>W: authoritative snapshot
    W-->>C: ROOM_SNAPSHOT(snapshot)
  end

  C->>C: apply seq monotonic and drop old events
  Note over C,API: PubSub is wakeup only. Stream or snapshot repairs correctness.
